<title>FRANCE: Saint-Louis sells Panzalim stake to Danone.</title>
<headline>Saint-Louis sells Panzalim stake to Danone.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saint-Louis said in a statement it had sold its 34.5 percent stake in Panzalim to other food group Danone for an amount of about 2.9 billion francs ($555.9 million). ($ = 5.217 French Francs)</p>
</text>
